WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.667
Alright. We'll do one last one here.

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:04.167
-Alright. Great. -Alright. Here we go.

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:06.367
We'll do one last one here. It's from Sarah Munson.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:07.968
"Hey, Jimmy, I'm a big fan of Ford trucks,

00:00:07.968 --> 00:00:09.167
and I especially love

00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:11.968
their all-new F-Series Super Duty pickup truck."

00:00:11.968 --> 00:00:13.734
It's awesome. Work hard, play hard.

00:00:13.734 --> 00:00:18.133
The problem is, I love trivia games that involve a giant pie

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:19.501
made of whipped cream being launched

00:00:19.501 --> 00:00:20.934
at someone from a catapult.

00:00:20.934 --> 00:00:23.667
Is there any way you can combine those things?"

00:00:23.667 --> 00:00:27.200
Well, Sarah, you're in luck because...

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.467
[ Laughter ] -Wow.

00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:32.701
-There's a Ford Super Duty down in the 30 Rock Plaza

00:00:32.701 --> 00:00:34.267
with a catapult attached to it

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:37.133
that can launch a giant whipped cream pie through the air.

00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:39.400
Let's do this!

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:42.133
Wanna do this? Come on, Higg. Come on, Tariq.

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:43.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:49.601
♪♪

00:00:49.601 --> 00:00:55.467
♪♪

00:00:55.467 --> 00:00:58.000
Hey, guys, we're down in the 30 Rock Plaza.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.534
Tariq and I are about to play the Ford Mega Pie Challenge.

00:01:01.534 --> 00:01:04.534
Higgins, tell us how it works. -Well, the game is simple.

00:01:04.534 --> 00:01:06.601
In front of you is a Ford Super Duty

00:01:06.601 --> 00:01:08.601
equipped with a whipped-cream catapult.

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:10.367
You'll answer trivia questions

00:01:10.367 --> 00:01:13.567
designed to test your knowledge about the Super Duty.

00:01:13.567 --> 00:01:15.634
If you guess right, you move on.

00:01:15.634 --> 00:01:19.434
If you guess wrong, you must press the cream launcher,

00:01:19.434 --> 00:01:22.734
which will randomly trigger the giant pie to be thrown at you.

00:01:22.734 --> 00:01:25.000
Alright. Here's your first question.

00:01:44.501 --> 00:01:47.100
-I'm a pumpkin hauler myself.

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:50.267
Pumpkins average around 4 pounds per pumpkin.

00:01:50.267 --> 00:01:51.934
-Oh, my God. -I'm gonna say my answer is B.

00:01:51.934 --> 00:01:53.968
-B. That is correct!

00:01:53.968 --> 00:01:55.567
10,000 pumpkins.

00:01:55.567 --> 00:01:58.968
Tariq, it's your turn in the cream zone.

00:01:58.968 --> 00:02:00.901
And here's your question.

00:02:19.767 --> 00:02:21.267
-I'm gonna say "A." I'm gonna say "A."

00:02:21.267 --> 00:02:22.400
-"A."

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:23.634
[ Buzzer ] Ooh, sorry.

00:02:23.634 --> 00:02:25.801
"C, 360 degrees.

00:02:25.801 --> 00:02:27.334
-Oh, great.

00:02:27.334 --> 00:02:29.868
You must now press the cream launcher.

00:02:29.868 --> 00:02:33.334
-Yeah! Come on! -Which may or may not

00:02:33.334 --> 00:02:37.067
trigger the pie to be catapulted unto you.

00:02:37.067 --> 00:02:39.501
Good luck. -Good luck, bud.

00:02:39.501 --> 00:02:41.300
[ Suspenseful music ]

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:47.067
♪♪

00:02:47.067 --> 00:02:48.434
[ Ding ]

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:50.400
-Ohh. -Whew!

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:52.300
-Unbelievable. -Jimmy -- You survived, Tariq.

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:54.968
Jimmy, you're up. Your question is...

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:17.567
-So does the truck have the torque of a truck?

00:03:17.567 --> 00:03:19.801
-Does it? That's up to you.

00:03:19.801 --> 00:03:22.400
-Trying to trick me, but sure. -You're gonna go "A"?

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:23.601
-Yeah.

00:03:23.601 --> 00:03:24.601
[ Buzzer ] -Ooh. Wrong!

00:03:24.601 --> 00:03:26.334
It is "B," a semi truck.

00:03:26.334 --> 00:03:28.501
Jimmy, press the cream launcher.

00:03:28.501 --> 00:03:29.634
Good luck!

00:03:29.634 --> 00:03:31.567
[ Suspenseful music ]

00:03:31.567 --> 00:03:39.100
♪♪

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:40.167
[ Ding ]

00:03:40.167 --> 00:03:42.334
Ohh! You survived.

00:03:42.334 --> 00:03:45.400
Tariq, you're up. -Unh!

00:04:02.634 --> 00:04:04.033
-I'm gonna go "D," all of the above.

00:04:04.033 --> 00:04:07.467
-This is insane. -That is correct! "D." Yes!

00:04:07.467 --> 00:04:10.067
Alright, Jimmy, your question. -I know.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:18.567
[ Laughter ]

00:04:18.567 --> 00:04:20.834
-Is it, "A," eggs and toast...

00:04:20.834 --> 00:04:22.567
"B," cereal...

00:04:22.567 --> 00:04:24.434
"C," steel-cut oatmeal...

00:04:24.434 --> 00:04:26.734
or, "D," a raspberry pain au chocolat

00:04:26.734 --> 00:04:29.367
with a quiche Lorraine and a warm hazelnut ganache

00:04:29.367 --> 00:04:31.400
with a hint of cinnamon? -Hint of cinnamon.

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:33.901
-I am definitely going -- I've been to breakfast with you.

00:04:33.901 --> 00:04:35.200
It is "D."

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:36.734
[ Buzzer ] -Oh, no!

00:04:36.734 --> 00:04:38.901
Of course, it's "C," steel-cut oatmeal.

00:04:38.901 --> 00:04:41.267
Come on, man! Time to press it, baby.

00:04:41.267 --> 00:04:43.133
Press the launcher. -Moment of truth.

00:04:43.133 --> 00:04:45.100
[ Suspenseful music ]

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:47.767
♪♪

00:04:47.767 --> 00:04:49.434
[ Engine revs ]

00:04:49.434 --> 00:04:54.501
♪♪

00:04:54.501 --> 00:04:57.033
[ Mozart's "Requiem in D Minor" plays ]

00:04:57.033 --> 00:05:07.033
♪♪

00:05:07.033 --> 00:05:16.968
♪♪

00:05:16.968 --> 00:05:19.000
[ Applause ]

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:25.634
♪♪

00:05:25.634 --> 00:05:27.334
-Ohh!

00:05:27.334 --> 00:05:29.100
[ Laughter ]

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:34.033
-That's all the time we have for Suggestion Box.

00:05:34.033 --> 00:05:37.100
Thank you so much to Ford. Really, thank you, Ford.

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:39.300
We'll be right back with more "Tonight Show," everybody.

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:40.534
Oh, my gosh.

